---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Quality & After-Sales Policy | TOYFACTORY">
  <main class="pt-40 pb-32 bg-[#0A0A0F] min-h-screen">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-8">
      <h1 class="text-5xl font-display font-extrabold text-white mb-16 uppercase italic">Quality & <span class="text-gold">After-Sales.</span></h1>
      
      <div class="space-y-12 text-gray-400 leading-relaxed uppercase tracking-wide text-xs">
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-white text-lg font-bold mb-6 italic">1. WHOLESALE TERMS</h2>
          <p>AS A B2B MANUFACTURER, ALL WHOLESALE ORDERS ARE FINAL. WE DO NOT ACCEPT RETURNS OR EXCHANGES FOR "CHANGE OF MIND" OR UNEXPECTED MARKET FLUCTUATIONS. ONCE AN ORDER IS CONFIRMED AND PRODUCTION BEGINS, IT CANNOT BE CANCELLED.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-white text-lg font-bold mb-6 italic border-l-4 border-gold pl-4">2. 7-DAY INSPECTION PERIOD</h2>
          <p class="text-white font-bold bg-white/5 p-6">ANY CLAIMS FOR MANUFACTURING DEFECTS, DAMAGE DURING TRANSIT, OR QUANTITY DISCREPANCIES MUST BE SUBMITTED TO OUR SALES REPRESENTATIVE WITHIN 7 BUSINESS DAYS UPON RECEIPT OF GOODS. CLAIMS MADE AFTER THIS PERIOD WILL NOT BE ENTERTAINED.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-white text-lg font-bold mb-6 italic">3. CLAIM PROCEDURE</h2>
          <p>TO INITIATE A CLAIM, PLEASE PROVIDE THE FOLLOWING EVIDENCE TO <span class="text-gold">HNTOYS7@SINUOTOYS.COM</span>:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-4 space-y-2">
            <li>ORDER NUMBER AND PACKING LIST REFERENCE.</li>
            <li>CLEAR PHOTOS AND VIDEOS OF THE DEFECTIVE ITEMS.</li>
            <li>PHOTOS OF THE ORIGINAL OUTER SHIPPING CARTONS SHOWING LABELS AND SHIPPING MARKS.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-white text-lg font-bold mb-6 italic">4. RESOLUTION</h2>
          <p>VERIFIED MANUFACTURING DEFECTS WILL BE RESOLVED VIA:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-4 space-y-2">
            <li>REPLACEMENTS INCLUDED IN YOUR NEXT ORDER.</li>
            <li>CREDIT NOTES TO BE APPLIED TO FUTURE INVOICES.</li>
            <li>REPAIR KITS OR SPARE PARTS SENT VIA FAST COURIER IF APPLICABLE.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <div class="pt-12 border-t border-white/10">
          <a href="/" class="text-gold hover:text-white transition-colors font-bold">&larr; BACK TO HOME</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
